'''Roses''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 75 [[coins]]{{Currency|Old Coin}} during the [[Valentines Event 2016|2016 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of red roses, hence the name. The guard is dark green, and the handle is solid black. 

== Trivia ==
*Roses is the first of the six knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Valentine_Set Valentine Set], the others being [[Valentine]], [[Passion]], [[Blossom (2016)|Blossom]], [[Hearts]] and [[Sweetheart]].

